SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - August Social Mixer
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **August International 
 Social Mixer** we will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belgiu
 m Brewery (River Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of fo
 lks to welcome you!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and meet 
 some new folks!\n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgium
 ’s beautiful deck overlooking the river. If it is raining\, we’ll move
  inside to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL Internationa
 l Connections' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us!\n\nA loca
 l Food Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to eat!\n\nAs a
  growing group (over 1500 members)\, if you have friends that you would li
 ke to bring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign up on Meetup!
